# This package is not compatible with transactional (frozen) update
# systems. It ships pre-generated libX11 compose caches under
# /var/cache/libx11/compose, a directory that is compiled into libX11
# and cannot be relocated from this package. The cache file names
# embed a hash of the source compose file, so stale entries
# self-invalidate, and the cache must persist across
# snapshots/rollbacks rather than roll back with the system. The
# dir-or-file-outside-snapshot finding is therefore not actionable
# from this package.
addFilter("dir-or-file-outside-snapshot")
